in Inuktitut.\n\nAny help would be appreciated!\n\nThanks,\n\nBen','ASAP',545,'2019-09-12 17:55:26','2019-09-12 17:55:26'),(20099,'Let\'s try this again..\n\n\nHey folks, we\'re just starting up a new hockey team in our local rec league and need to get a set of jerseys going. We\'re looking at going with the old school California Seals with Sky Blue, gold and white. I can\'t seem to find a decent \'Seals\" logo for the front anywhere. But essentially we\'d just want the original logo with sky letters and gold trim in the same font. I\'ve attached a picture of the shoulder patch logo, as well. Can the colours be altered to sky blue and gold or do I need to provide an exact picture to use?\n\nAs for the number we\'d look at having them 2 colour in the back - sky with gold trim and sky blue with gold trim on the arms. Also, in the name bar we were wondering if you folks could write ᓇᑦᓯᖅ - this means seal in Inuktitut. \n\nAlso could be add the inuksuk under the collar?\n\nAny help would be appreciated! Thanks, Ben',NULL,546,'2019-09-13 00:29:59','2019-09-13 00:29:59'),(20100,'Hello\r\n\r\nI would be needing this design preferably on the center of the front of the jersey, I’m wanting one set of home and one set of away uniforms. White for home and black or blue for away, the white I’d like to have blue paneling down the side of the jerseys and shorts, the colors from our logo would be best. We’re also wanting player names on the back. We will need 12-13 of each uniform, can you quote the price please?\r\nI’ve attached our logo and the style I like.','Oct 15',553,'2019-09-13 17:41:33','2019-09-13 17:41:33'),(20101,NULL,NULL,554,'2019-09-13 19:00:06','2019-09-13 19:00:06'),(20102,NULL,NULL,555,'2019-09-13 19:17:41','2019-09-13 19:17:41'),(20103,NULL,NULL,556,'2019-09-13 19:19:51','2019-09-13 19:19:51'),(20104,NULL,NULL,557,'2019-09-13 19:33:49','2019-09-13 19:33:49'),(20105,NULL,NULL,558,'2019-09-13 19:34:57','2019-09-13 19:34:57'),(20106,'number on the front and back log