ndividual names and numbers of the back of the Jerseys.','March 9th',1128,'2019-11-17 22:50:17','2019-11-17 22:50:17'),(20544,'Logo on the front, small number on front, larger number son back and possible sponsor logo or name on back','asap',1129,'2019-11-18 02:05:16','2019-11-18 02:05:16'),(20545,'TOSH LIGHT HAULING',NULL,1130,'2019-11-18 06:49:55','2019-11-18 06:49:55'),(20546,'TOSH LIGHT HAULING on front',NULL,1131,'2019-11-18 06:54:21','2019-11-18 06:54:21'),(20547,'4/xs, 5/s, 4/m, 2/L, 1/xl\r\n\r\n1 color imprint on front \r\n\r\nInclude a freight quote and an ETA \r\n\r\nThanks \r\n\r\nMike',NULL,1132,'2019-11-18 14:25:35','2019-11-18 14:25:35'),(20548,'Hi there. The jersey would have company symbol. Pretty straight forward. I can send a picture via email if we decide to go with your company.','Feb.1/2020',1133,'2019-11-18 15:46:01','2019-11-18 15:46:01'),(20549,'# on front and back of jersey\n\nSchool logo on left chest (charger horse)','Nov 25, 2019',1135,'2019-11-18 17:21:39','2019-11-18 17:21:39'),(20550,'Will provide logo in eps format.\r\nNeed numbers and names on back.','Spring',1136,'2019-11-18 17:25:49','2019-11-18 17:25:49'),(20551,'You provided a quote on a different style last week, but we thought we would check another style before making the order.\nDetails\nNumber and team name on middle front\nNumber on middle back as well as a small logo between shoulders above the back number\nWe would also need matching shorts (14)','Dec. 5, 2019',1137,'2019-11-18 19:01:49','2019-11-18 19:01:49'),(20552,'We have 3 sponsors and a crest we\'d like on the jersey!\nSo our crest, small - Left Chest\nOne sponsor - Right Sleeve\nOne Sponsor - Left Sleeve\nOne Sponsor - Lower Back\nand just numbers, no names.\nAll the sponsors and numbers would be black.',NULL,1139,'2019-11-19 00:21:00','2019-11-19 00:21:00'),(20553,'Simple school logo\nnumber on front\nnumber on back',NULL,1140,'2019-11-19 02:46:10','2019-11-19 02:46:10'),(20554,'We are taking a U12 Little league t