size and location of number on back','feb 26',1494,'2020-01-16 15:25:24','2020-01-16 15:25:24'),(20845,'Front Center: Huskies (2 colours) on one line\nor\nHoly Saviour (small on top) Huskies (large on second line)\nNumbers on front below team name if possible\nNumbers on back\nSchool husky logo on back in replacement of name\n\nThis quote involves two possible styles we are interested in. So if possible separate quotes for the 1101/1102 and the 1055/1056.',NULL,1495,'2020-01-16 17:05:49','2020-01-16 17:05:49'),(20846,'Just looking to price out these jerseys to take total costs to the team.','ASAP',1498,'2020-01-16 22:27:46','2020-01-16 22:27:46'),(20847,'Front of jersey team name and logo provided all in one.\r\nSmall Canadian flag on right arm sleeve.\r\nNumber on left arm sleeve.\r\nNumber on back.',NULL,1499,'2020-01-16 23:26:27','2020-01-16 23:26:27'),(20848,'We are looking for a quote for 20 jerseys with our logo on them. 10 in each colour.','April',1500,'2020-01-16 23:40:33','2020-01-16 23:40:33'),(20849,'We are the sanfransico giants baseball team. We want the giants on front , numbers on back and last names','May 2 2020',1501,'2020-01-17 16:48:49','2020-01-17 16:48:49'),(20850,'Would also include want:\n -a Logo/or HAMMERS written front and center of jersey\n-Small player numbers left/below Logo/HAMMERS (front)\n-Larger player number on back of jersey',NULL,1502,'2020-01-17 20:18:14','2020-01-17 20:18:14'),(20851,'Team logo on the front and only number on the back.',NULL,1503,'2020-01-18 03:13:49','2020-01-18 03:13:49'),(20852,'Team logo on left chest, name on left sleeve, number on the back ( all the same number)','March 30th',1504,'2020-01-18 20:11:44','2020-01-18 20:11:44'),(20853,'Black  number 9',NULL,1505,'2020-01-19 00:23:39','2020-01-19 00:23:39'),(20854,'Artwork will just be a specific font logo, no artwork-style logo. Placement will be across the chest. Numbers on the back, and name across the upper shoulder above the number. Will have a couple specialty sizes (2xl, 3xl, will know quantities of each after our AGM). Colours may change depending on sponsor request, but I don\'t think that would affect pricing would it?','Asap - need to give quote to sponsor for approval',1506,'2020-01-19 04:31:58','2020-01-19 04:31:58'),(20855,'We require our logo in the front center chest with small numbers on the front bottom left and large on the back. No player names.','March',1507,'2020-01-19 13:45:30','2020-01-19 13:45:30'),(20856,'We would like the players last name on the back and number. \r\nA logo on the front.',NULL,1508,'2020-01-19 16:18:10','2020-01-19 16:18:10'),(20857,'Team name is the SHOTGUNNERS that we have in a cursive style logo. Numbers on the back with no names. May have a sponsor logo on the sleeve. Looking to get quote.',NULL,1509,'2020-01-19 19:30:08','2020-01-19 19:30:08'),(20858,NULL,NULL,1510,'2020-01-19 23:28:34','2020-01-19 23:28:34'),(20859,'We would like the same lettering style and location but we would like it to say Foul Balls','may 1st',1511,'2020-01-20 01:21:47','2020-01-20 01:21:47'),(20860,'wholesale quote -\n\nsublimation on the front, number on the back\n\nalso, the shorts to match','ASAP',1512,'2020-01-20 14:32:16','2020-01-20 14:32:16'),(20861,NULL,'some time in march',1513,'2020-01-20 18:00:34','2020-01-20 18:00:34'),(20862,'We are just needing a basic jersey with the number on the back and logo on the front. Depending how much we may want the number on the sleeves as well.','01/20/2020',1514,'2020-01-20 18:05:53','2020-01-20 18:05:53'),(20863,'We would want jerseys with different names and numbers as well as the words \"Ora et Labora\", \"Ramsey House\", and hopefully a logo as well depending on costs','February 20th',1515,'2020-01-20 20:27:22','2020-01-20 20:27:22'),(20864,'Hi there, \r\n\r\nI put in a quote a month or two ago, so I do know the prices I will be looking at when I do place the actual order. I was wondering if it would be possible to send you a few different colour ways, and number/logo options for a jersey, so we could actually see how they’d look complete? I know on the site it allows you to pick your colour ways, but the jersey displayed doesn’t actually change to your colours you can only see your choices below the colour options. \r\n\r\nFirst Jersey Option (black, white, gold):\r\nI would like to get the school name front center (MEMORIAL), as well as the number front center under the school name, both in white. Then just the number centred on the back in white as well. Would also like to see one done with the school name and numbers in gold instead of white, to view that style. \r\n\r\nSecond Jersey Option (black, kelly, gold):\r\nI would like to get the school name front center (MEMORIAL), as well as the number front center under the school name, both in kelly. Then just the number centred on the back in kelly as well. Would also like to see one done with the school name and numbers in gold instead of kelly, to view that style. \r\n\r\nThen, if possible, I have the school logo here, but it won’t let me attach it to this quote. I will have to send it in a separate email. \r\n\r\nI would like to see the first jersey option, with the school logo instead of the schools name on front with the number underneath, and with the logo option, I’d like to have the schools name across the back (MEMORIAL) above the number. With the logo option I’d also like to see the name and numbers in white, as well as in gold. \r\n\r\nI would like to see the second jersey option, with the school logo instead of the schools name on front with the number underneath, and with the logo option, I’d like to have the schools name across the back (MEMORIAL) above the number. With  the logo option I’d also like to see the name and numbers in kelly, as well as in gold.\r\n\r\nALSO IF POSSIBLE, I would like to see all the same options for the second jersey style, but could I replace the “kelly” colour with the “forest” colour? And also a set of all the options for the second jersey style, but replace the “kelly” colour with the “olive” colour? The green in our logo is a little different then the kelly, so I want to see which one matches best. And with the school name on the front and number underneath could I see it both straight across for all the colour ways, as well as rainbowed for all the colour ways? \r\n\r\nI apologize for the many options, but we would just like to be able to see each style finished before we make our final decision. \r\nI will send an email directly after this attaching our school logo referencing my name for match up. \r\n\r\nThanks a million!','ASAP',1516,'2020-01-20 21:28:30','2020-01-20 21:28:30'),(20865,'We would like it to say Diamond Cutters on the front with each persons name and number on the back','Before May',1517,'2020-01-20 23:10:06','2020-01-20 23:10:06'),(20866,'We’re looking for child’s sizes (4-12yr olds) not sure if you offer products in these sizes. We’d be looking for just a name across the front with a number no graphics required.',NULL,1518,'2020-01-21 01:46:26','2020-01-21 01:46:26'),(20867,'I would like a logo in front like the dodgers name in blue\r\nRed numbers in the back\r\nno name\r\nsmall red number on sleeves',NULL,1519,'2020-01-21 03:02:47','2020-01-21 03:02:47'),(20868,'Swoosh Team Name \r\n\r\nNO BIG DEAL',NULL,1520,'2020-01-21 05:27:38','2020-01-21 05:27:38'),(20869,NULL,NULL,1521,'2020-01-21 15:36:33','2020-01-21 15:36:33'),(20870,'Our logo is about a 4 colour logo.  We would prefer to have in on the centre, but for the full button jerseys we would maybe have the logo on the side with the name of our team on the front. \r\n\r\nNumbers would be included as well on the back. \r\n\r\nI would like 17 units of one of the requested quotes, I would like to compare costs first :) \r\n\r\nThanks!','March 1st, 2020',1522,'2020-01-21 17:38:07','2020-01-21 17:38:07'),(20871,'We are looking to supply 600 Box Lacrosse jerseys\nassorted of Youth and Adult. aprox 14 Goalie c