ck\n\nwith initials at the bottom: SQ',NULL,2228,'2020-05-11 13:56:39','2020-05-11 13:56:39'),(21471,'HORNETS in block letters with number under it on Front\nHornet Logo (3 colours - we have one) under colour and number on Back\n\nHi Rahim,\nCan you tell me if the 1037 fit and sizing is the same as jersey SVB 1076LS as that is what I am gauging sizing by.','June 30th',2229,'2020-05-11 14:04:11','2020-05-11 14:04:11'),(21472,'I have   art work and design  \n\ndepending on how much   per   jersey  may order more  I need to know how much one will cost per jersey','june  15,2020',2231,'2020-05-14 20:18:55','2020-05-14 20:18:55'),(21473,'Hi,\r\nYou did some sublimated hockey jerseys for us a few years ago, and now I need a quote for 48 SSC-1082.  There  will be 6 colours (6 teams) at 8 units per team.\r\nEach team will need their own sublimation on the front and back of the shirt.\r\nCan you please give me a price for this.\r\nIf you need to call me, cell is best 416 873-0404.',NULL,2232,'2020-05-15 10:07:48','2020-05-15 10:07:48'),(21474,'Hello my name is Lenny Weasel Head I order some jerseys from you a year ago team name Smokin bases.can u put the name Smokin bases on the front and the baseball on the back I can send a picture if you don’t have a copy thanks we really like our jerseys',NULL,2233,'2020-05-17 09:55:44','2020-05-17 09:55:44'),(21475,'Team logo on top left of front of jersey and name and number centered on the back of the jersey.','June 06, 2020',2234,'2020-05-17 10:37:41','2020-05-17 10:37:41'),(21476,'- numbers front center at least 10cm\n- numbers back center at least 15cm\n- Logo (3-colours) on back, above numbers (name placement area)',NULL,2235,'2020-05-19 23:12:32','2020-05-19 23:12:32'),(21477,NULL,NULL,2237,'2020-05-20 09:54:21','2020-05-20 09:54:21'),(21478,'Looking to get a general quote for set of jerseys for our team. Also what are reorders worth?','5-20-2020',2238,'2020-05-20 15:02:08','2020-05-20 15:02:08'),(21479,NULL,NULL,2241,'2020-05-26 14:05:52','2020-05-26 14:05:52'),(21480,'none',NULL,2242,'2020-05-26 19:04:19','2020-05-26 19:04:19'),(21481,'We would have a logo(wording maybe) in the front as well as a number in the front and a number in the back.  These will be for volleyball so we have to make sure that size of the numbers and the location of the logo meets the requirements of the volley-ball association of Alberta.\n\nIf the price of the long sleeves vary from one style to another then I would like a quote on all of these.  If they are all the same no need to send a quote pour all the different long sleeves.\n\nSame thing for the short sleeved ones.\n\nWe are looking to buy a set of 15.','June 20th',2243,'2020-05-27 23:33:03','2020-05-27 23:33:03'),(21482,'We don\'t have a logo yet but it would be a logo on the front of the jersey with a small number. \n\nIs it more expensive to put names on the back of the jersey?\n\nThanks!',NULL,2244,'2020-05-28 08:56:22','2020-05-28 08:56:22'),(21483,'Looking at ordering 2 sets of volleyball jerseys, I would like mock ups of the 4 different jersey please so we can choose. This order coincides with Dale Hunters jerseys from Kehewin Community Education Centre.',NULL,2245,'2020-05-28 10:48:03','2020-05-28 10:48:03'),(21484,'Brush script numbers front center & back centre(black with Fuschia border)  \r\n\r\nBlack unicorn logo on the left chest \r\n\r\n10 adult and 1 youth size if possible \r\n\r\nWe are unsure if we want names on the back, is that an option with the brush script numbers? To use a different font for names if we choose?',NULL,2246,'2020-05-28 20:06:00','2020-05-28 20:06:00'),(21485,'We would prefer to have numbers and a team crest in the \"left chest\" on each jersey. No logos required. The shorts would have no numbers of crest','July 6, 2020',2247,'2020-05-29 14:04:08','2020-05-29 14:04:08'),(21486,'2-color logos on the left chest, names below the collar',NULL,2248,'2020-05-30 20:54:41','2020-05-30 20:54:41'),(21487,'2-color logos on the left chest, names below the collar',NULL,2249,'2020-05-30 21:03:45','2020-05-30 21:03:45'),(21488,'Hello, just like a idea of pricing for a team of 14, women’s softball for the vball style jersey vs the full button baseball please.','Asap',2250,'2020-06-01 00:22:35','2020-06-01 00:22:35'),(21489,NULL,'June 1st 2020',2251,'2020-06-01 14:46:53','2020-06-01 14:46:53'),(21490,'Simple one-colour logo on front.\n\nname, number, sponsor name on back.','july 10',2254,'2020-06-02 10:38:05','2020-06-02 10:38:05'),(21491,'I would like to receive a quote for 25 white face masks, with my son\'s soccer team logo and possibly the number of each player on the face mask, so that each face mask could be identified to its respective owner.  The below is a link to his Soccer Club\'s website, so you can see the logo.  While amateur soccer has not gotten the green light as yet, I thought this would be a nice return gift for the players.  I should let you know that, at the moment this has not been sanctioned by the Coach nor the Club.  Depending on the quote, I will obtain all necessary approvals.\nhttps://www.rushsoccer.com/\nThank you.\nC Weston','At your convenience',2256,'2020-06-05 08:46:20','2020-06-05 08:46:20'),(21492,'Logo on left chest with with number right, below logo and back, center','asap',2257,'2020-06-05 13:59:51','2020-06-05 13:59:51'),(21493,'SB (stands for Shady Boyz) logo in gold on the front left breast. Numbers in gold on the back. Potentially names as well depending on the price..',NULL,2258,'2020-06-06 21:24:23','2020-06-06 21:24:23'),(21494,'Sponsor logos, team logo, team name, sleeve detailing.',NULL,2259,'2020-06-07 12:04:38','2020-06-07 12:04:38'),(21495,'I run a full time Goalie program with 4 or 5 separate camps and use 3 jersey designs. This first quote is for a specific Female camp we run. I need 14 of these jerseys then another similar jersey but with different colours and need 12 of those. Curious on cost per jersey with name, number on arms and back and the