'2021-07-06 08:57:08'),(22735,'I WOULD LIKE TO HAVE \"PARROTT\'S\" ACROSS THE FRONT CENTER CHEST. I HAVE A PARROTTS SYMBOL I WOULD LIKE TO GO WITH THE FRONT CHEST LETTERING I WOULD LIKE LAST NAMES ON THE BACK OF JERSEYS WIT NUMBERS, ALSO I WOULD LIKE NUMBERS ON THE RIGHT SLEEVE.','JULY 23, 2021',3779,'2021-07-06 10:12:33','2021-07-06 10:12:33'),(22736,'logo would be front center, numbers on back.\r\nLeft below center would have number, names on back also.','asap',3780,'2021-07-06 11:13:31','2021-07-06 11:13:31'),(22737,'Were looking to restock our organization with new uniforms, shorts and jerseys, we have 100 kids with the expectation there will be more in the years to come. We use the bulls logo and our colours are black and white but we would entertain some hints of grey if the jersey is tri colour. 150 is a rough number will confirm once the quote is recieved it may be slightly less like 140.','September',3783,'2021-07-06 14:14:27','2021-07-06 14:14:27'),(22738,NULL,'08-01-2021',3784,'2021-07-06 14:32:02','2021-07-06 14:32:02'),(22739,'Hi!  I have artwork (EPS file) from my graphic designer.  She only gave me 5 jerseys with logos/# and last names.  I\'ll need to make changes by taking off the last names and adding more numbers. I\'m hoping you can work with the current file I have.  Also, do you do coaches shirts?','August 2, 2021',3785,'2021-07-06 17:01:49','2021-07-06 17:01:49'),(22740,'Soccer ball in corner of chest and possibly sponsor logo. Number on back','July 5,2021',3786,'2021-07-07 00:22:46','2021-07-07 00:22:46'),(22741,'We need volley ball jerseys and need different sizes too.','July 7',3787,'2021-07-07 01:47:32','2021-07-07 01:47:32'),(22742,'We have a custom logo with team name at the base that we would like on the from left chest. And then gold numbering on the back.','ASAP',3789,'2021-07-07 10:12:39','2021-07-07 10:12:39'),(22743,'Team name on front of jersey: Choke n’ Pokes \r\n\r\nNumber on back middle of jersey with last names on top jersey on back','July 7, 2021',3791,'2021-07-07 13:28:17','2021-07-07 13:28:17'),(22744,'I would just want Ball Knockers on the front and Campbell Construction in the name placement. No numbers needed or logo','Asap',3792,'2021-07-07 17:21:20','2021-07-07 17:21:20'),(22745,'We don’t need any art just blank jerseys. How fast could I get them and how much?',NULL,3793,'2021-07-07 17:55:35','2021-07-07 17:55:35'),(22746,'No logo.\nJust team name in the front, numbers on the back and a name in the back.',NULL,3795,'2021-07-07 23:23:55','2021-07-07 23:23:55'),(22747,'a small logo on the front in the upper left-hand corner. number and name on the back. small number on the front centre.','august 4th',3798,'2021-07-08 17:13:26','2021-07-08 17:13:26'),(22748,'Hi there, \n\nI am looking to order 15 adult sized baseball jerseys (assorted sizes men and women). We want black jerseys with maroon writing. On the front we want our law firm’s name “Brownlee” and on the back we want our last name on 13 of the jerseys and player number. We want two jerseys with no last names as extras. \n\nI have a budget of $675. I am wondering if you could provide me with a quote as to whether or not your company can provide us with jerseys for under our budget, and if not what the price would be. I also would like an estimate as to when the jerseys will be ready.\n\nPlease feel free to phone me back (403)888-9737 (preferred) or send an email. \n\nThanks so much for your time, \n\nAshley.','July 21, 2021',3799,'2021-07-08 17:51:35','2021-07-08 17:51:35'),(22749,'If this could be done as reversible we would like to know the price of both reversible and separate.\n\nFor front of the jerseys, (#1 and #4):\nTeam Logo Front Center\nSponsor Logo Right Chest\nPlayer Number Left Below Logo\n\nFor back of the jerseys:\nName above Number\nNumber\n\nFor shorts if possible team name on front left.',NULL,3800,'2021-07-08 23:11:33','2021-07-08 23:11:33'),(22750,NULL,'July 24',3801,'2021-07-09 10:23:39','2021-07-09 10:23:39'),(22751,'All JURSEY\'S NEEDS TO BE REVERSABLE\nPlayer Names & Numbers (Varsity).  Numbers in Light Blue and black borders.  Names in Black with light blue borders.\nTeam Name in Hamilton (Front Center)\nPlayer number on front right chest, same font and colours as on the back.\nLeft chest we want team logo.\nSHORTS\nCan we do player number on the bottom right.','30 July 2021',3804,'2021-07-09 20:34:39','2021-07-09 20:34:39'),(22752,'Team logo on front of jersey large and centered\r\nName on top back\r\nNumber mid back\r\nSponsor logo below numbers','ASAP - we are playing now',3806,'2021-07-10 14:12:22','2021-07-10 14:12:22'),(22753,'Hi, we are wanting a logo on the front of the jersey, number on the front top corner of the chest, and number on the back. We had our first game already and our next game is Friday July 16 if we could get a rush order that would be greatly appreciated! Please let me know how to send our logo etc.? I can be reached at lesleefitzgerald@gmail.com \r\nThank you in advance',NULL,3807,'2021-07-10 18:15:26','2021-07-10 18:15:26'),(22754,'We would have one logo, a name and a number per jersey. I am not sure I pressed on the correct colour, but we would want a full red with white lettering/number. No other colour on the jersey please.','ASAP',3808,'2021-07-10 20:09:29','2021-07-10 20:09:29'),(22755,'Front-Team name and number\r\nBack- player name,number, sponsor name on lower back. \r\n\r\nWe may want to add art on sleeve.','09/01/21',3809,'2021-07-11 00:25:52','2021-07-11 00:25:52'),(22756,'Hello I am looking to order t am uniforms for a new school in Barrie, Ontario.  I was hoping someone could do a few mock ups for me using our logo.','Sept 2021',3810,'2021-07-11 08:39:10','2021-07-11 08:39:10'),(22757,'Looking to have “pitch better have my money” on the front, numbers and names. \r\nLooking to get them ASAP. With covid rules lifting our season is starting unexpectedly','July 11th',3811,'2021-07-11 10:46:04','2021-07-11 10:46:04'),(22758,'Just the name, no logos\r\nLast Name and number on back',NULL,3812,'2021-07-11 14:52:45','2021-07-11 14:52:45'),(22759,NULL,'2022',3813,'2021-07-11 15:11:09','2021-07-11 15:11:09'),(22760,'Just team name on front\r\nLast name and number on back',NULL,3814,'2021-07-11 15:22:33','2021-07-11 15:22:33'),(22761,'Artwork placement in the middle of the front, no player names will be needed as these are tournament jerseys. 15 plus a goalie. Will have a sponsor','Sept 3rd,2022',3815,'2021-07-11 16:14:21','2021-07-11 16:14:21'),(22762,'We would like the team name across the chest in the format of \r\n      Cedar \r\n    Hillbillies \r\nAnd numbers and names on the back',NULL,3816,'2021-07-11 19:42:26','2021-07-11 19:42:26'),(22763,'Jersey:\n-Numbers on the back:\n      -L#55\n      -XL#09\n      -M#44\n      -M#02\n      -XL#27\n      -L#00\n      -M#11\n      -M#21\n      -S#24\n      -S#22\n      -M#22\n      -L#13\n      -M#13\n      -M#20\n      -XL#7\n      -XL#14\n      -L#88\n      -L#35\n      -M#99\n      -L#01\n      -XL#18\n-C&K Services above numbers on back\n-Small number on front left\n-\"Balls Deep\" on the front\n\nHoodies:\n-Numbers on the back:\n      -L#55\n      -XL#09\n      -M#44\n      -M#02\n      -XL#27\n      -L#00\n      -M#11\n      -M#21\n      -S#24\n      -S#22\n      -M#22\n      -L#13\n      -M#13\n      -M#20\n      -XL#7\n      -XL#14\n      -L#88\n      -L#35\n      -M#99\n      -XL#01\n-C&K Services above numbers on back\n-Small number on arms\n-\"Balls Deep\" on the front   \n\n\nDo you have any hats?  If do, trucker style hat. # on Side of hate,, \"\nBalls Deep\" .On front black cap with red text..\n\n\nCan we see a couple different tFonts  for options?','ASAP - Shipping to Nunavut',3818,'2021-07-11 21:21:27','2021-07-11 21:21:27'),(22764,'i have a logo that i want on the front, numbers on front and back no name required \n\nalso include for items to be rushed \n\nthanks','July 23',3819,'2021-07-11 22:07:25','2021-07-11 22:07:25'),(22765,NULL,'Asap',3820,'2021-07-11 22:31:31','2021-07-11 22:31:31'),(22766,'\"Tommy\'s\" across the front',NULL,3821,'2021-07-11 23:19:36','2021-07-11 23:19:36'),(22767,'We are looking for our team name on the front (Cedar Hillbillies) and names and numbers on the back.',NULL,3822,'2021-07-12 04:36:18','2021-07-12 04:36:18'),(22768,'logo on front, different numbers on each jersey back\ncan pick up from your location','july 22, 2021',3823,'2021-07-12 05:21:47','2021-07-12 05:21:47'),(22769,'Some sort of Logo on the front saying \" PITCH better have my money\" and numbers on the back','as soon as possible',3824,'2021-07-12 08:03:13','2021-07-12 08:03:13'),(22770,'Our own logo. The Longshots',NULL,3825,'2021-07-12 11:34:36','2021-07-12 11:34:36'),(22771,'Hi, \n\nI am looking for a quote for jerseys for our softball team, we would want to have them in either of the styles selected looking for quotes and lead times as would like them ASAP.\n\nThanks,\n\nAlexa','ASAP',3826,'2021-07-12 11:56:18','2021-07-12 11:56:18'),(22772,'\"Ishkode\" on Swoosh lettering Front Center\nModern Impact Number on the back \nLast name on the bottom back','July 30th',3828,'2021-07-12 15:20:53','2021-07-12 15:20:53'),(22773,'Artwork on the front and number on the back',NULL,3829,'2021-07-12 15:38:35','2021-07-12 15:38:35'),(22774,'I would like the team name to be D&EL Inc. Ballas. I\'ll put it in order of Jersey #, Last Name for the back and Size. Where the logo and everything is of template of jersey is how I would like it designed with the chosen colours. \n\n#1 - Skinner - Medium\n#10 - Dominix - Large \n#4 - Kolola - Extra Small\n#13 - Ipeelie - Small\n#2 - Macdonald - Medium \n#19 - Cote - Large\n#3 - Simic - Large \n#6 - Merkosak - Extra Large\n#9 - Duggan-Ipeelie - Small \n#66 - Ipeelie - Large \n#5 - Ottokie - Small \n#88 - Cox - Large \n#11 - Dunphy - Large \n#7 - Enuaraq - Small\n#8 - Bourassa - Large \n#69 - Tilley - Large \n#14 - Qaurniq - Small\n#12 - (no last name) - Large \n#15 - (no last name) - Small \n#16 - (no last name) - Medium','July 12 2021',3830,'2021-07-12 15:53:11','2021-07-12 15:53:11'),(22775,'Team name will be on the front in the center. Number will be on the back centered.','asap',3832,'2021-07-12 16:59:30','2021-07-12 16:59:30'),(22776,'Numbers Front/Back\nLeague Logo on back nameplate\nSponsor Logo top of front numbers\n\nWould probably change Jersey style for each division.  Include 4 different styles with these numbers:\nMite - 30\nTyke - 90\nAtom - 90\nPeewee - 90','Sept 18th',3834,'2021-07-12 22:05:07','2021-07-12 22:05:07'),(22777,'Team name HIT & RUN across chest\nSponsor logo across bottom back. \nName on top on back\nNumber on back.',NULL,3835,'2021-07-12 22:42:45','2021-07-12 22:42:45'),(22778,'Team name on the front # on the back.\n\n13 regular and 1 goalie cut.\n\n1 x S\n\n2 x M\n\n6 x L\n\n4 x XL\n\n1 x goalie (xl)','07/25/21',3836,'2021-07-13 06:15:38','2021-07-13 06:15:38'),(22779,'We would like the jerseys to say \"Delaware\" on the front, and on the back we would like nicknames. All the jerseys will be #65 for the year the residence was founded!','August 31, 2021',3837,'2021-07-13 09:32:51','2021-07-13 09:32:51'),(22780,'I would like to request a per player quote for the following:\n\n-   Jersey: Dry fit shirt with 1 color front, 4 color right and left sleeve print.  1 color sponsor name and number on back\n-	Dry fit soccer shorts\n-	Soccer socks\n-	Soccer shin guards\n\nThank you!','ASAP',3838,'2021-07-13 11:14:26','2021-07-13 11:14:26'),(22781,'Front, team name\nBack number and player name\nSponsorship logo on arm or bottom of back of Jersey',NULL,3839,'2021-07-13 12:24:05','2021-07-13 12:24:05'),(22782,'Just a written logo on the front centre with little number front left below logo and on the back as well with names and  3 sponsor logos on the back bottom centre','As soon as possible',3841,'2021-07-13 12:58:14','2021-07-13 12:58:14'),(22783,'Just logos, numbers and sponsor names on it',NULL,3843,'2021-07-13 16:42:44','2021-07-13 16:42:44'),(22784,'We are looking for 10 boys large goalie cut jerseys and 20 men’s large goalie cut jerseys. \r\nOur name on the back, logo on the front and numbers on the arms…\r\nI need to know turn around time and approximate cost. \r\nThank you \r\nMichael','August 8th',3844,'2021-07-13 19:29:57','2021-07-13 19:29:57'),(22785,'file:///var/mobile/Library/SMS/Attachments/9a/10/FA0E5608-81D1-4581-A065-CDA8D2C59268/26D0BEB7-03D7-4E4B-98A5-4B26D9FB6249.heic','Aug 26',3846,'2021-07-14 02:42:08','2021-07-14 02:42:08'),(22786,NULL,'july-14-2021',3847,'2021-07-14 09:28:25','2021-07-14 09:28:25'),(22787,'Names and number on the back.  On the front a full colour logo across the chest. Looks kind of like blue jays logo but drinking a beer and says “brew jays”. We have image.','ASAP (whenever$',3848,'2021-07-14 09:31:34','2021-07-14 09:31:34'),(22788,'Logo on front\r\nName and number on back','ASAP',3849,'2021-07-14 10:58:01','2021-07-14 10:58:01'),(22789,'Would like team name on front center of the jersey to read \"Swainson Miki Peskett\" for all, small logo on right sleeve, and all numbers to read \"20,\" and customized names on back.\n\nWe would need the jerseys by August 17th, 2021','August 17th, 2021',3852,'2021-07-14 14:06:04','2021-07-14 14:06:04'),(22790,'“Rangers” diagonally down the front of the jersey. Numbers on the left chest. Quote w/wo number on the chest','Asap',3854,'2021-07-15 08:06:45','2021-07-15 08:06:45'),(22791,'Numbers on the back\r\nTeam Logo on the front\r\nSponsor logo on the right sleeve (maybe, please send quote with and without one)','July 15 2021',3855,'2021-07-15 08:52:18','2021-07-15 08:52:18'),(22792,'team logo,sponsor name ,team name,and number.20 +20 two different sets',NULL,3856,'2021-07-15 09:16:04','2021-07-15 09:16:04'),(22793,'We require numbers on the back. \nLogo for front will be provided.',NULL,3857,'2021-07-15 10:12:22','2021-07-15 10:12:22'),(22794,NULL,NULL,3858,'2021-07-15 11:00:34','2021-07-15 11:00:34'),(22795,'Looking jerseys for the hockey team I am looking to create and have running this coming fall, COVID dependent obviously. Looking to get a quote on how much it would be for 25-30 jerseys. \n\nWe do have a logo create but could not figure out how to upload it here for you to see.\n\nLooking to also maybe get some sponsorship, would you be able to put a sponsors patch on? If so, would that be extra?','Looking to get the jerseys for the fall.',3859,'2021-07-15 16:08:30','2021-07-15 16:08:30'),(22796,'We are a Canadian amateur soccer travel team attending the World Masters Games in Kansai Japan in May 2022. We are looking for quality uniforms for this event, our 4th WMG\'s. \n\nWe would like a logo on each arm, 8\" numbers on back, and Indigenous Canadian flag on the front with \"CANADA under the flag.\n\nJust looking for prices at this point','January 2022',3860,'2021-07-15 16:14:32','2021-07-15 16:14:32'),(22797,'All Swedish No Finish - Center front 2 lines\nName and number on back\nNumber on sleeves\nBlack Print for all lettering. \n\nInterested in corresponding shorts. \nNumber on right leg','ASAP',3861,'2021-07-15 16:24:15','2021-07-15 16:24:15'),(22798,'I would like all jerseys numbered and the team name on the front \r\nTeam name Cornwall Court FC','July 16,2021',3863,'2021-07-16 05:14:10','2021-07-16 05:14:10'),(22799,NULL,'July 16,202',3864,'2021-07-16 05:15:52','2021-07-16 05:15:52'),(22800,'i am looking for sublimated black and gray sublimated baseball jersey blanks, no artwork on them. \nthanks, Shane.',NULL,3865,'2021-07-16 14:34:41','2021-07-16 14:34:41'),(22801,'team name on front. SPORTIN WOOD. Team logo on right arm. Personal name and number on back.','Soon as possible',3868,'2021-07-16 23:42:05','2021-07-16 23:42:05'),(22802,'Tommy\'s in script front center',NULL,3869,'2021-07-17 04:48:22','2021-07-17 04:48:22'),(22803,'numbers and a stock logo or team name - like Saints or Wildcats.  No player name.  Just a basic jersey for a throw together men\'s hockey team.','ASAP - summer hockey begins 27 July',3870,'2021-07-17 08:58:13','2021-07-17 08:58:13'),(22804,'- \"As\" logo on the front over the chest/stomach.  Note: this logo could be without the apostrophe of the traditional \"A\'s\".\n\n- Number on the back.\n\n- \"Canadian Press\" logo on the sleeve.\n\nAnother option would be to find out how much the same order is for 16 jerseys would cost if the \"As\" logo was smaller and over the heart.\n\nThanks!','August 10, 2021',3871,'2021-07-17 11:26:19','2021-07-17 11:26:19'),(22805,'Hey there, \nwe have a logo that we would want added to the front, plus numbers on the back. I can\'t find where to attach the file with the logo plus everyone\'s number and sizes. could you help me sort that out?\n\nthank you\nJon Penney',NULL,3872,'2021-07-17 12:14:17','2021-07-17 12:14:17'),(22806,'Would like it to say ABC pools on the front - like a crest. \r\nOn the back across the top saying ABC pools and then a large number on the back from 2 to 26','Asap',3873,'2021-07-17 18:16:23','2021-07-17 18:16:23'),(22807,'We will have only numbers on the back and a logo which we will have ready shortly. The team name is Trailblazers. We are able to pick up the jerseys since it is made in Markham, Ontario.','August 9, 2021',3874,'2021-07-17 22:05:33','2021-07-17 22:05:33'),(22808,'jersey numbers on back',NULL,3875,'2021-07-18 12:15:51','2021-07-18 12:15:51'),(22809,'Logo in black front center. \r\nBlue numbers on back. \r\n19 player cut \r\n1 goalie cut','ASAP',3876,'2021-07-18 14:57:19','2021-07-18 14:57:19'),(22810,'Company logo on the back and smaller version on the front',NULL,3877,'2021-07-18 18:56:40','2021-07-18 18:56:40'),(22811,'This is for a co-ed softball team. We are called the litigators bracket it looks like Florida Gators logo.\n\nWe would like last names on the back along with Numbers in the front. \n\nThe season has already started but we are not in a rush as jerseys are not mandatory this year',NULL,3878,'2021-07-18 19:01:40','2021-07-18 19:01:40'),(22812,'Front centre \r\n\r\nThe words would be “sweaty sluggers” with a slug with a baseball on it tail holding a bat.','ASAP',3879,'2021-07-18 22:36:23','2021-07-18 22:36:23'),(22813,'Need logo on front and numbers on back.','August 19 2021',3881,'2021-07-19 05:34:49','2021-07-19 05:34:49'),(22814,'The jersey number may fluctuate a bit.  They would also be split 50/50 between a light (home) and a dark (away) jersey.  \r\n\r\nWe would also like a quote on matching performance socks.',NULL,3882,'2021-07-19 07:03:57','2021-07-19 07:03:57'),(22815,'We are celebrating our 25 yr anniversary and we figured we can put NORTHSTAR at the front. Teacher name at the back. Our logo under school name.\nWe want to also include their chosen number. Lastly, a place to put 25 years on the sleeve or somewhere in front. If you can advise, please call me at school and dial ext 224','Aug 19, 2021',3883,'2021-07-19 10:05:15','2021-07-19 10:05:15'),(22816,NULL,NULL,3885,'2021-07-19 10:50:42','2021-07-19 10:50:42'),(22817,'Hi there, we are looking for an image of an eagles head for the front center of the jersey (no lettering on front), last name below the collar and number at center on the back.  \nThis is for a U12 soccer team, so would be interested in youth sizes as well if you have them. \nThank you, \nKate - U12 Team Manager','July 19 2021',3887,'2021-07-19 14:38:10','2021-07-19 14:38:10'),(22818,'LOGO - Broke Millionaires\r\nNumbers on backs of jerseys \r\nPlayer nick name on back \r\nSmall version of number one front','Aug 1 2021',3888,'2021-07-19 14:45:11','2021-07-19 14:45:11'),(22819,'Sublimated','Asap',3889,'2021-07-19 16:40:52','2021-07-19 16:40:52'),(22820,'If we could use the same Knights Logo you have on the website is either the grey or white it would be perfect.\n\nI am looking for 17 total jerseys - 2 would be a goalie cut.','7/31/2021',3890,'2021-07-19 17:45:14','2021-07-19 17:45:14'),(22821,'If we could use the same Knights Logo you have on the website is either the grey or white it would be perfect. I am looking for 17 total jerseys - 2 would be a goalie cut.','7/31/2021',3891,'2021-07-19 17:54:09','2021-07-19 17:54:09'),(22822,'We currently have a logo that’s two beer mugs cheersing with our team name (Brew Jays) but we are open to anything really. We would love the logo front centre or right upper corner. We would love names on the back but no numbers. Thanks so much!!',NULL,3892,'2021-07-19 19:13:32','2021-07-19 19:13:32'),(22823,'We are looking for apparel for our dance team - currently we know we want our company logo either front centre and/or Right/Left Chest, and potentially name below collar. Dance teams don\'t have numbers per team member but I see on the \'artwork placement guide\' that there are many possible combinations that we will have to discuss. For now, we simply want those customizations quoted. Question: are images screen printed or embroidered? Thank you!','July 19 2021',3893,'2021-07-19 20:03:03','2021-07-19 20:03:03'),(22824,'We are looking for apparel for our dance team - currently we know we want our company logo either front centre and/or Right/Left Chest, and potentially name below collar. Dance teams don\'t have numbers per team member but I see on the \'artwork placement guide\' that there are many possible combinations that we will have to discuss. For now, we simply want those customizations quoted. Question: are images screen printed or embroidered? Thank you!','July 19 2021',3894,'2021-07-19 20:21:45','2021-07-19 20:21:45'),(22825,'See previous descriptions','July 19 2021',3895,'2021-07-19 20:53:06','2021-07-19 20:53:06'),(22826,'Front Center team name crest in 2 colors\nFront number below crest and number on the back',NULL,3896,'2021-07-19 21:16:44','2021-07-19 21:16:44');
