9-08-28 01:14:57','2019-08-28 01:14:57'),(1070,'7511234','All the names, numbers, and Logo\'s plain white. \n\nThe Goalie Jersey should be a 3XL','1','White','White',NULL,448,'2019-08-28 15:51:38','2019-08-28 15:51:38'),(1071,NULL,'if you look at my pictures i have 2 choices. The checked blue if possible or the other one with the hexagon details. The team name is BLUEPERS. writing like the 2nd picture and numbers too. For the amount i need 12 numbers. Id give you the list of names too and exacte numbers. Im looking for a quote. Can you help me out?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,456,'2019-08-29 02:43:43','2019-08-29 02:43:43'),(1072,NULL,'Logo on the left chest and sleeves. Player names on the back in white.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,461,'2019-09-01 19:06:16','2019-09-01 19:06:16'),(1073,NULL,NULL,'1','Red',NULL,NULL,477,'2019-09-05 15:26:48','2019-09-05 15:26:48'),(1074,NULL,'OUR LOGO ON LEFT CHEST IN (WHITE COLOR)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,478,'2019-09-05 17:38:46','2019-09-05 17:38:46'),(1075,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,491,'2019-09-09 11:59:13','2019-09-09 11:59:13'),(1076,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,492,'2019-09-09 12:52:38','2019-09-09 12:52:38'),(1077,'reorder','Logo on front. Number on back.','2','White','Black',NULL,493,'2019-09-09 12:54:32','2019-09-09 12:54:32'),(1078,'asdasd','logo on front number on back','2','White','White',NULL,494,'2019-09-09 12:58:25','2019-09-09 12:58:25'),(1079,'123123',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,495,'2019-09-09 13:00:54','2019-09-09 13:00:54'),(1080,NULL,'Predator Logo - Front Center (Scratch marks changed to white)\n# - Below Logo\nSponsor Logo - Below Collar Back\n# - Large Center back\nName - Lower Back','1','White',NULL,NULL,496,'2019-09-09 18:02:31','2019-09-09 18:02:31'),(1081,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,502,'2019-09-10 08:39:32','2019-09-10 08:39:32'),(1082,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,503,'2019-09-10 08:45:01','2019-09-10 08:45:01'),(1083,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,504,'2019-09-10 08:49:41','2019-09-10 08:49:41'),(1084,NULL,'-Barons 