 form below. I would like the #13 jersey to be a libero jersey. I understand the extra $10 and am okay with that. I would also like to get a rush on this order as well please.','2','Royal','Black',NULL,552,'2019-09-13 16:07:19','2019-09-13 16:07:19'),(1105,NULL,'Logo on front left chest. In charcoal with white border please.','2','Charcoal','White',NULL,561,'2019-09-14 15:25:48','2019-09-14 15:25:48'),(1106,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,567,'2019-09-14 21:01:45','2019-09-14 21:01:45'),(1107,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,568,'2019-09-14 21:03:19','2019-09-14 21:03:19'),(1108,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,570,'2019-09-14 21:10:05','2019-09-14 21:10:05'),(1109,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,571,'2019-09-14 21:10:41','2019-09-14 21:10:41'),(1110,NULL,NULL,'yellow',NULL,NULL,NULL,580,'2019-09-16 11:07:23','2019-09-16 11:07:23'),(1111,'20066','Please use the \"B\" with the serifs, from the mock up.  Also please have \"the\" and \"team\" offset above and below the letter B, in an even smaller size and italicized.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,586,'2019-09-16 22:45:06','2019-09-16 22:45:06'),(1112,NULL,NULL,'brown','brown','brown',NULL,592,'2019-09-17 14:54:34','2019-09-17 14:54:34'),(1113,'Web Inquiry #20119','STINGERS and number on the front centre, number on the back (as in mock up example from Tuesday, Sept 17 @ 3:02 pm.','2','black','white',NULL,606,'2019-09-18 15:14:16','2019-09-18 15:14:16'),(1114,NULL,'Logo front Center\r\nNames and number on the back\r\nNumbers in the sleeves','2','Black','White',NULL,633,'2019-09-22 21:30:12','2019-09-22 21:30:12'),(1115,'Teamco Ref #20136','Not sure what inside and outside colors mean so I put in white.\n\nWe need the attached logo and the number under the logo on the front.\nOn the back, it would be just a name and a number\nPlease, make it a rush order. We would appreciate to have it as soon as possible since we\'re already playing. \n\nNOTE: All prints should be in white\n\nThank you!','White','White','White',NULL,637,'2019-09-23 15:16:37','2019-09-23 15:16:37'),(1116,NULL,'We have placed several orders in the past; I will attach a PDF confirmation of a past order that includes all the design details and logo. I hope it contains a vector image (or you still have one from an old order) because nobody at work seems to have one...','Gold',NULL,NULL,NULL,651,'2019-09-24 20:11:32','2019-09-24 20:11:32'),(1117,'3051 - Stadnyk','Logo Front Center, Number Right Chest, Logo Left Sleeve, Large Number Back Center','2','Red','Black',NULL,652,'2019-09-24 20:12:26','2019-09-24 20:12:26'),(1118,'Stadnyk - 3051','Jersey Number Right Chest, Logo Center Chest, Logo Left Chest, Number Center Back.  All Reds should be 1815C','2','1815C','Black',NULL,653,'2019-09-24 20:33:05','2019-09-24 20:33:05'),(1119,NULL,'I provided a picture of the logo to be placed on front center. I also provided the JPEG version just in case. Please do not include the white background on the jerseys. I provided names as well as numbers (placed under names) on each jersey. Thanks for your help and let me know if there is any other info you may need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,657,'2019-09-25 01:47:35','2019-09-25 01:47:35'),(1120,'Greg','Main logo front center. Would like Canadian flag on right sleeve, and  small version of logo on left sleeve.','white','white','black',NULL,678,'2019-09-27 12:22:32','2019-09-27 12:22:32'),(1121,NULL,'As per attached picture here is a description of the artwork placement\r\n1: Front Center: Club Full Logo\r\n2: Left Chest: Small. number\r\n3: Bottom left Sleeve: Club Name\r\n4: Back Center: Large Number\r\n5: Below Collar: Club Small Logo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,704,'2019-09-30 12:40:59','2019-09-30 12:40:59'),(1122,'20213','Front left chest: school logo \nFront center: number (10 cm) \nBack center: number (15 cm) \nBelow collar: school logo\n\nPlease print both the numbers and logos in black with a white outline.','black','black','white outline',NULL,712,'2019-09-30 17:30:57','2019-09-30 17:30:57'),(1123,NULL,'Team nam